  "steps": [
    "Heat the oven to 175 °C and line a pan with parchment.",
    "Melt the butter and let it cool slightly. Rub the lemon zest into the sugar.",
    "Mix the sugar into the butter for about 1 minute, then whisk in the eggs and lemon juice until glossy.",
    "Fold in the flour, salt and baking powder until just combined, and spread in the pan.",
    "Bake 20–25 minutes, until the edges are set and a toothpick comes out mostly clean.",
    "Glaze: whisk the powdered sugar with the lemon juice (add a little more juice if it's too thick) and spread over the cooled brownies. Let it set before slicing."
  ]
